{{!< default}}
{{!-- WHS Brief: custom route (not a collection) rendering only #industry-brief
tagged posts via {{#get}}. Sibling page to brief.hbs (the weekly
jurisdiction brief) — same structure and same paying-member inline-embed
behaviour, just a different tag and monthly cadence instead of weekly.
Posts still get the site's normal /{slug}/ permalink (from the unfiltered
"/" collection in routes.yaml) — this page is purely a filtered browsing
view, not a permalink prefix. See routes.yaml.

Paying members (@member.paid) skip the generic masthead/Subscribe banner
entirely and see the current month's full brief embedded directly at the
top instead, with older months still listed as cards below (the current
month is excluded from that list so it isn't shown twice). Anonymous/free
visitors keep the original masthead + Subscribe CTA + full card list
exactly as before, current month included as Ghost's normal locked card. --}}

<main id="site-main" class="site-main outer">
<div class="inner posts">

    {{#unless @member.paid}}
    <div class="whs-brief-doc">
        <div class="wbd-masthead">
            <p class="wbd-eyebrow">Work Health &amp; Safety — Monthly Industry Brief</p>
            <h1>WHS &amp; OHS legislative changes by industry</h1>
            <p class="wbd-dek">WHS &amp; OHS amendments, commencements and proposals relevant to construction, mining and resources, manufacturing, agriculture and forestry, transport and logistics, health care and aged care and utilities cutting across every Australian jurisdiction.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="whs-brief-intro">
            <p>Every month: WHS/OHS legislative change organised by industry instead of by state, so you can jump straight to what's relevant to your sector, each item sourced and linked back to the regulator, court record or legal publisher it came from.</p>
            <a class="gh-head-button" href="#/portal/signup" data-portal="signup">{{t "Subscribe"}}</a>
        </div>
    </div>
    {{/unless}}

    {{#get "posts" filter="tag:industry-brief" limit="all" include="tags,authors" as |posts|}}

        {{#if @member.paid}}
            {{#with posts.[0]}}
                <article class="whs-brief-current">
                    {{content}}
                </article>
            {{/with}}
        {{/if}}

        <div class="post-feed">
            {{#foreach posts}}
                {{#if @first}}
                    {{#unless @member.paid}}
                        {{> "post-card"}}
                    {{/unless}}
                {{else}}
                    {{> "post-card"}}
                {{/if}}
            {{else}}
                <p class="none">No posts yet.</p>
            {{/foreach}}
        </div>

    {{/get}}

</div>
</main>
